    "detailed_description": "Rekesh Gaal - is a Hack &amp; Slash Action RPG.<br>You are a wanderer chosen to fight evil. Choose your path, explore gloomy locations and find secret places. Defeat your enemies through complex character development, hundreds of unique items and crafting.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782620/extras/1cd410533b7cea9c2c5ca7c46350a8ed.poster.avif?t=1719962757\" width=624 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782620/extras/1cd410533b7cea9c2c5ca7c46350a8ed.webm?t=1719962757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782620/extras/1cd410533b7cea9c2c5ca7c46350a8ed.mp4?t=1719962757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><strong>Explore the Unknown.</strong><br>Traverse varied towns, ancient ruins and dungeons as you unravel the mysteries of the world of Rekesh Gaal. Assume the role of a lone hero, venturing into the heart of malevolence that has gripped the world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782620/extras/adc2e9f8904c58173fff742f6ea11f45.poster.avif?t=1719962757\" width=624 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782620/extras/adc2e9f8904c58173fff742f6ea11f45.webm?t=1719962757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782620/extras/adc2e9f8904c58173fff742f6ea11f45.mp4?t=1719962757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Infinite Combination of Skills. </strong><br>Create your own unique character class using over 210 different skills across 30 skill branches.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782620/extras/471b0c646bec9c1849076a5737d6e474.poster.avif?t=1719962757\" width=624 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782620/extras/471b0c646bec9c1849076a5737d6e474.webm?t=1719962757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782620/extras/471b0c646bec9c1849076a5737d6e474.mp4?t=1719962757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Special Skills-Forms.</strong><br>Hunt for exceptionally rare components - the Elemental Particles to unlock special Form Skills.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782620/extras/396fb997672481a15e1744d0162348ed.poster.avif?t=1719962757\" width=624 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782620/extras/396fb997672481a15e1744d0162348ed.webm?t=1719962757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782620/extras/396fb997672481a15e1744d0162348ed.mp4?t=1719962757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Items.</strong><br>Collect Hundreds of Items: Common, rare, legendary and epic classes of loot. Upgrade your favorite weapons or armor of any rarity to unprecedented power. In Rekesh Gaal, you don't have to constantly change your favorite weapon or armor to new or rarer ones.<br><br><strong>Recipe Based Crafting</strong> <br>Collect over 500 crafting recipes that allow you to create unique crafted items or artefacts and then, later, use those basic crafted items with higher-tiered recipes to complete items of fantastic power. Use recipes to upgrade your favorite weapons or armor of any rarity.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782620/extras/2a95eb1b6be02c52398f835cd15ed6d9.poster.avif?t=1719962757\" width=624 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782620/extras/2a95eb1b6be02c52398f835cd15ed6d9.webm?t=1719962757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782620/extras/2a95eb1b6be02c52398f835cd15ed6d9.mp4?t=1719962757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
